10.steps:
 1.Create a NM policy with explicit route as the probe type;
2.Create an address object say AOtarget with host type of  lan zone  and ip 10.10.10.10/24 ;
3.Create an address object say AOgateway with host type of lan zone and ip 192.168.168.10/24;
