27.steps:
1.Add several NM policies;
2.Wait for the pseudo-LEDs turn green or red;

Put the mouse over the pseudo-LEDs, check that following statistics are provided:
1) Successful probe percentage;
2) Number of Resolved probe targets;
3) Total number of probes sent;
4) Total number of successful probe responses received;
5) A list of resolved probe targets and their status.

Click the clear statistics button; check the statistics again.

