42.steps:
Add a reachable address object of host type name hostAO;
Click the add button on Network Monitor Policies page;
Enter a policy name like hostProbe;
Expand the probe target dropdown list, select the hostAO,
Select a probe type and do corresponding configuration, then click the ok button;
Wait for several seconds, check the policy status;
Disconnect the egress interface, wait several seconds and check the policy status.

