1.From Network->Route Policies add a route with any connected egress interface -DO NOT select the Disable route on interface-disconnect;
2.Select a probe policy from the network monitor probe dropdown list;
3.Select the checkbox of Probe default state is up;
4.Edit the selected policy to make the status to unknown;
5.Switch to the static route quickly, check the status of it;
6.Disconnect the egress interface of the selected policy, wait till its status is down;
7.Check the static route, it should be disabled.

